  (text "TPS3808G01: 0.405 V threshold, CT floating gives 20 ms delay. Supervisors are supplied from USB 5 V.\nCORE_ENABLE = IO18_OK AND IO33_OK. RESET_N = CORE_ENABLE AND CORE_OK.\nNominal thresholds: 1.687 V / 3.035 V / 0.863 V. Include regulator and supervisor tolerances in the release calculation."
